---
<section class="distinction">
    <div class="distinction-text">
        <h2>Clinical expertise in a fractured system.</h2>
        <p>While the healthcare system is brilliant, it is often busy and impenetrable. I provide the clinical connection my clients need to make informed, high-stakes decisions under pressure.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="badge-list">
        <li class="badge-item">Physician Assistant-Certified</li>
        <li class="badge-item">15 Years Clinical Experience</li>
        <li class="badge-item">Oncology & Complex Care Specialties</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<style>
    .distinction {
        padding: 8rem 5%;
        background: var(--white);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 4rem;
        align-items: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    .distinction-text h2 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .distinction-text p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .badge-list {
        list-style: none;
    }

    .badge-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
    }

    .badge-item::before {
        content: "";
        width: 20px;
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--royal-blue);
    }

    /* Tablet and Mobile Breakpoint */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .distinction {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 2.5rem;
            padding: 4rem 5%;
        }
        .distinction-text h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .badge-item {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
    }
</style>